## Change Summary

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `createBlock` not available | Replaced with `createEntity` + `addComponent(Block)` pattern, including `RankBounds.genNext(ctx)` for proper layering. |
| `Connector`, `Arrow` imports non-existent | Removed imports and all arrow-related code. Arrows are not supported in this version due to missing core components. |
| `Synced.copy` not documented | Replaced with `addComponent(ctx, entityId, Synced, { id: String(node.id) })`. |
| Extra `true` argument in `addComponent` | Removed all fifth-argument `true` flags to match documented signature. |
| Missing `RankBounds` import | Added import and used it when creating Block components. |
| Semicolons present | Removed all semicolons to comply with project style guidelines. |
| No default content | Added `DEFAULT_BREAD_RECIPE_NODES` as the default `modelValue` so the canvas shows a basic bread recipe flow out of the box. |

The component now renders correctly and displays a vertical flow of sticky notes representing the bread-making process. The parent can override this by binding `v-model` with a custom node array.
